# Goal Description

The goal is to synchronize the side panel navigation across three distinct platforms (`frontend-liart-gamma-68`, `avani-ai-crm`, and `avani-loan-agents`) and integrate the system with several powerful third-party services: HubSpot, Google Sheets, Zapier, Google AI Studio, Twilio, Webhooks, OmniDim, and AiSensy. 

Since this requires significant API architecture changes and business logic implementations, I have prepared this implementation plan to ensure everything is built exactly to your specifications.

> [!WARNING]
> **Extensive Requirements Ahead**
> Integrating 8 new platforms is a major undertaking. To prevent writing code that does not fit your business flow, I need your guidance on the exact triggers and data mappings for these integrations.

